# 🚀 GSoC Proposal – Phobos Performance Optimization

This repository contains my Google Summer of Code proposal.

## 📌 Project Title
Enhancing Performance of the Phobos Standard Library in the D Ecosystem

## 👤 About Me
My name is Cyrus, and I am a student with a Certificate in ICT. I have a strong interest in programming and software development. I am passionate about contributing to open-source projects and improving my coding skills.

## 🎯 Project Goal
The main goal of this project is to improve the performance and efficiency of the Phobos Standard Library by:
- Identifying performance bottlenecks  
- Optimizing algorithms and code structure  
- Reducing memory usage  
- Improving execution speed  

## 🛠️ Technologies
- D Programming Language  
- Phobos Standard Library  
- DMD Compiler  
- Dub Package Manager  
- Git & GitHub  

## 📈 Expected Outcome
- Faster and more efficient Phobos modules  
- Improved code quality and performance  
- Well-tested and documented improvements  

